## Tutorials

When each operation depends on the previous one, use multipleawaitstatements.

If asynchronous operations are independent, they can start at the same time.

This is called running tasks in parallel.

All three downloads begin immediately.

Theawaitstatements wait only when the results are needed.

ThePromise.all()method waits for several Promises to complete.

It returns a single Promise that resolves when every Promise has been fulfilled.

You can combinePromise.all()withresponse.json().

If one Promise is rejected, the Promise returned byPromise.all()is also rejected.

ThePromise.allSettled()method waits until every Promise has finished.

UnlikePromise.all(), it does not stop when one Promise is rejected.

Each result contains a status offulfilledorrejected.

ThePromise.any()method returns the first fulfilled Promise.

Rejected Promises are ignored unless every Promise is rejected.

ThePromise.race()method returns the first Promise that settles.

The first Promise may be fulfilled or rejected.

